        ["1"] = <"Exclusion of examination, Published archetype [Internet]. openEHR Foundation, openEHR Clinical Knowledge Manager [cited: 2022-07-25]. Available from: https://ckm.openehr.org/ckm/archetypes/1013.1.1846.">
